WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.390
Who stole the cookies?

2
00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:10.830
We must find the thief.

3
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:15.030
I believe the thief is the chief.

4
00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:18.310
He put the cookies in his briefcase.

5
00:00:19.503 --> 00:00:22.257
“Not me,” cried the chief.

6
00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:24.890
“I don’t like cookies.

7
00:00:25.122 --> 00:00:26.880
Look in my briefcase.

8
00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:28.670
There is just a pie.”

9
00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:32.719
I believe the thief is the fierce lion.

10
00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:36.380
He put the cookies in his briefcase.

11
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:40.746
“Not me,” cried the fierce lion.

12
00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:42.960
“I don’t like cookies.

13
00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:45.060
Look in my briefcase.

14
00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:47.220
There is just a tie.”

15
00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:52.160
Then, I believe the thief is the chief’s niece.

16
00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:55.040
She put the cookies in her briefcase.

17
00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:59.660
“Not me,” cried the chief’s niece.

18
00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:01.640
“I don’t like cookies.

19
00:01:01.886 --> 00:01:03.510
Look in my briefcase.

20
00:01:03.787 --> 00:01:05.620
There is just fried chicken.”

21
00:01:06.725 --> 00:01:10.080
Then, I believe the thief is the collie.

22
00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:12.860
He put the cookies in his briefcase.

23
00:01:13.987 --> 00:01:17.026
“I cannot lie,” said the collie.

24
00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:19.020
“I ate the cookies.

25
00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:21.000
Doggies love cookies.”

26
00:01:23.928 --> 00:01:52.432
fierce lion
